<lb n="1"/>Ernveste, Fromme, Fuersichtig, Ersam unnd
<lb n="2"/>Weise, euch seige unnser guetwillige dinst,
<lb n="3"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruetz</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wz</unclear> wir mehr ehren liebs
<lb n="4"/>unnd guets vermuegen, zuvor, Inßonders guensti-
<lb n="5"/>ge liebe herren, unnd guete freundt.
<lb n="6"/>Unns hat zeiger dißes unnser lieber mitburger,
<lb n="7"/><persName resp="#ner">Hanns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wadus</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heutigs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tages</unclear> vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geseßenem</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>Rath, mit betruebnuß fuebringen laßen, Wel-
<lb n="9"/>licher gestalt er unß vor lengst, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßere</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schriftlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Intercession</unclear>, bei euch den herren
<lb n="11"/>erschinen, in hoffnung daselbsten seiner gege
<lb n="12"/><persName resp="#ner">Jacoben Fritschi</persName> uewerß mitburgers seligen,
<lb n="13"/>habender <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechtmäßiger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldforderung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegeschickten</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbezalten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Feschen</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/>so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> . <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">64</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlauft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desto</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schleuinig</unclear>-
<lb n="16"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">furderlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zahlhaft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zewenden</unclear>, aber
<lb n="17"/>biß dato nit ainß hellers werth, noch wußen
<lb n="18"/>waruf die sachen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ald</unclear> wie er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bezalt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muege</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechten</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">satten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschaidt</unclear>
